<title>FINLAND: FINNISH MAY FOREIGN TRADE DATA DUE TODAY AT 1200.</title>
<headline>FINNISH MAY FOREIGN TRADE DATA DUE TODAY AT 1200.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish May foreign trade data will be released today at 1200, the National Customs Board (NCB) said in a statement on Thursday.  </p>
<p>In April, Finland's trade surplus was 3.83 billion markka, according to NCB data.</p>
<p>The Bank of Finland earlier estimated the May foreign trade surplus at 4.6 billion markka with exports seen at 15.5 billion and imports at 10.9 billion.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
